$ | $-1$ | $-2$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](images/e8/e8cfffa1c9aaba887d90a9251a0c67402343b5a47dbb31cd85c6e648ba800e4e.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259563 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "085993bd-69ec-5743-a939-105f113b1a54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/eb/ebe900771f97b3f439e5e86bd18aed25d7f213e31142cf1aad222a35d1d60318.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256851} {:answer/id #uuid "3dbf8508-301c-5b6a-b0bd-b0d1d2fab786" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/e1/e1bc60eace0dd586c67442903836d77faa4d5f30f63d15e80ebdea5286ec0ce8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257332} {:answer/id #uuid "5dd071bc-6185-5e01-97f2-dd548a0b37c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/25/25e37956c9e7a1b7511a9882747bd3d87aa34943b876473bdd83e0bfdafe9b56.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257604} {:answer/id #uuid "62d087ab-bea0-53fc-aa19-d334551861bf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/6b/6b6b7161a1b9c9c4dabe934534cf59d6412d97c9b095b4e8d4d338d328228a60.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186257653} {:answer/id #uuid "e68d9c69-59eb-5d90-a677-d5953fea9438" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497} :answer/value "images/64/64f1a97f0e4d869eceedfcc9b7db90eb6c036d2ab07ad079f545464e4b17e077.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186258782}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186257332} :answer-field/id #uuid "7c0d7864-654a-5cdb-b8ef-b9f56fa9f718" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186259241}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "4047f4e3-7a10-5d70-9b2c-847ce475f1de" :question/math-academy-id "q-123781" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\nx=t-1,\\,y={t}^{2}-5,\\,-3\\le t\\le 3\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We need to create a table of values and then 